Title: Basic Statistical Functions
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Lina", "Skog",
      email = "skoglina7@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: The basicstats package contains a few basic statistical functions.
    The Mean Absolute Error (MAE), Root Mean Squared Error (RMSE), Coefficient of
    Determination (R2) and correlation functions compute metrics between two sets
    of data. The accuracy, specificity, sensitivity, precision and negative
    predictive value (NPV) compute regression metrics for confusion matrices. 
